>-Why did i polymorphe into a white dragon ? 


If you polymorph while wearing dragon scale mail, you polymorph
into that kinda dragon.

>-Will this reproduce ?

Yes. It will happen every time. If you mean "Can I reproduce
as a dragon?", yes. Use #sit to lay an egg.

>-What does the HD:10 mean ?

Hit dice: 10. An AD&D concept. Monsters are not generated with a
specific number of hit points, but rather with a certain number
of hit dice, which are rolled to determine how many hit points
the monster has. Allows for some variability between monsters.
Also, HD are often used as an estimate of a monster's "level"
for combat purposes.

>-Why did i polymorphe back to human ?
> (was it because i was dying, or was it a great luck ?)

Because you were dying. You return to a human when you die
polymorphed. This is nice if you find yourself polymorphed
into, say, a jackal.


